  volume    =  113,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "800--835",
  abstract  = "I study the persuasive effects of slanted language, exploiting a
               ban on the politically charged term “illegal immigrant” by the
               Associated Press (AP) news wire. My empirical strategy combines
               the timing of the ban with variation across media outlets in
               their baseline reliance on AP copy. I document sizable diffusion
