  volume    =  113,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "738--765",
  abstract  = "Improving academic outcomes for economically disadvantaged
               students has proven challenging, particularly for children at
               older ages. We present two large-scale randomized controlled
               trials of a high-dosage tutoring program delivered to secondary
               school students in Chicago. One innovation is to use
