  author    = "Johnson, Matthew S",
  journal   = "American Economic Review",
  publisher = "American Economic Association",
  volume    =  110,
  number    =  6,
  pages     = "1866--1904",
  abstract  = "Publicizing firms’ socially undesirable actions may enhance
               firms’ incentives to avoid such actions. In 2009, the
               Occupational Safety and Health Administration (OSHA) began
               issuing press releases about facilities that violated safety and
               health regulations. Using quasi-random variation arising from a
