  volume    =  114,
  number    =  10,
  pages     = "3119--3160",
  abstract  = "Small firms struggle to grow beyond a few employees. We introduce
               monitoring devices into commuter minibuses in Kenya and randomize
               which minibus owners have access to the data using a novel mobile
