  abstract  = "We examine intergenerational mobility (IM) in educational
               attainment in Africa since independence using census data. First,
               we map IM across 27 countries and more than 2,800 regions,
               documenting wide cross-country and especially within-country
               heterogeneity. Inertia looms large as differences in the literacy
