  volume    =  93,
  pages     = "99--114",
  abstract  = "We use a unique regulatory event that occurred in Queensland,
               Australia, from 2007 to 2012, to examine the predictive power of
               landowner relationship networks and lobbying behaviour on
               successfully gaining value-enhancing rezoning. A State authority,
               the Urban Land Development Authority (ULDA), took planning
