  volume    =  96,
  number    = "9-10",
  pages     = "869--880",
  abstract  = "This paper describes and implements a method for valuing a
               time-varying local public good: air quality. It models survey
               respondents' self-reported happiness as a function of their
               demographic characteristics, incomes, and the air pollution and
               weather on the date and in the place they were surveyed. People
