  volume    =  96,
  number    = "9-10",
  pages     = "840--852",
  abstract  = "Changes in housing prices play an important role in determining
               the incidence of environmental regulations: if the increase in
               value due to changes in environmental amenities is fully passed
               forward in the form of higher rental prices, renters may receive
               no net benefit from the regulations. To estimate the pass-through
               of the value of an environmental amenity, I exploit the reduction
