  pages     = "113--132",
  abstract  = "The aim of this paper is to provide a new mechanism based on
               social interactions, explaining why distance to jobs can have a
               negative impact on workers’ labor-market outcomes, especially
               ethnic minorities. Building on Granovetter’s idea that weak ties
               are superior to strong ties for providing support in getting a
