  volume    =  98,
  pages     = "32--43",
  abstract  = "This paper investigates how industrial plants react to
               inspections conducted by environmental authorities under the
               pollution levy (taxation) regulation in China. Contrary to
               studies in the United States and Canada (Magat and Viscusi, 1990,
               Laplante and Rilstone, 1996), and previous studies in China
