  abstract  = "Turf wars in organizations commonly occur in environments where
               competition undermines collaboration. We develop a game theoretic
               model and experimental test of turf wars. The model explores how
               team production incentives ex post affect team formation
               decisions ex ante. In the game, one agent decides whether to
