  volume    =  99,
  pages     = "161--172",
  abstract  = "While a large literature addresses the societal cost of substance
               abuse across a number of domains, little is known about the
               impact of substance abuse on property values. This study uses
               unique data from Linn County, Oregon and a spatial,
               difference-in-difference identification strategy to test the
