               comments and to do so in reverse order to their presentation in
               the paper. In addition, I will expand on some other actions that
               Goodfriend touches on that a central bank might consider when
               interest rates are at zero. One of the principal elements in the
               debate about recent Japanese monetary policy (which is, of
