  abstract  = "An inter-governmental body is encouraging the replacement of
               currency with the objective of discouraging illegal economic
               activities. This policy is analyzed in a search-theoretic model
               where individuals choose legal or illegal production, settle
               trades via monetary or costly intermediated exchange, and where
