  pages     = "266--281",
  abstract  = "This article introduces covariance regression analysis for a
               p-dimensional response vector. The proposed method explores the
               regression relationship between the p-dimensional covariance
               matrix and auxiliary information. We study three types of
               estimators: maximum likelihood, ordinary least squares, and
