  pages     = "1,033--44",
  abstract  = "Empirical Bayes methods are used to estimate the extent of the
               undercount at the local level in the 1980 U.S. census. ``Grouping
               of like subareas from areas such as states, counties, and so on
               into strata is a useful way of reducing the variance of
