  number    =  1,
  pages     = "1--17",
  abstract  = "We use traffic data from a series of experiments in Israel and
               San Francisco to examine how illegal behavior is deterred by
               higher fines and whether deterrence varies with personal
               characteristics such as criminal record, driving record, income,
               and age. We find that red-light running decreases sharply in
