  volume    =  10,
  pages     = "199--204",
  abstract  = "1. Professor Buchanan hopes to illuminate the problem of public
               good provision by a simplified, idealized example of a TV relay
               on an island. I cannot agree that this ``ideal-type situation, or
               one closely resembling it'' captures what ``Samuelson initially
