  volume    =  38,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "521--559",
  abstract  = "This study's main contribution is examination of the excess
               capacity held by brewers during a period in which they tacitly
               cooperated on price. The analysis covers the industry in the
               United States between repeal of Prohibition in 1933 and wartime
               rationing of raw material in 1942. From April 1933 to May 1935,
