               with more reinvestment. Following Acemoglu and Johnson (2003.
               Unbundling institutions. Unpublished working paper 9934, National
               Bureau of Economic Research, Cambridge, MA), we separate our
               proxies for the security of property rights into two groups:
               those measuring the risk of expropriation by the government and
