               (INFORMS)",
  volume    =  29,
  number    =  5,
  pages     = "828--845",
  abstract  = "Whereas a growing body of research has examined the
               consumer-related implications of deceptive advertising, the stock
               market consequences stemming from the regulatory exposure of such
               infractions remain largely unexplored. In a step to address this
