               (INFORMS)",
  volume    =  32,
  number    =  7,
  pages     = "878--889",
  abstract  = "The Spatial Adaptive Filter (SAF), introduced in this paper, uses
               generalized damped negative feedback to estimate
               spatially-varying parameters for multivariate models. Previous
               adaptive filters have been designed to estimate time-varying
               parameters and process data recursively in time sequence. SAF
