  volume    =  30,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "137--155",
  abstract  = "The paper describes the results of an experimental test of a
               theoretical model which explains under what circumstances the
               interaction between MIS-users and EDP-specialists during the
               design of an information system will lead to success (i.e.,
               efficient task-accomplishment). The research also includes an
