  number    =  5,
  pages     = "619--645",
  abstract  = "This work investigates whether pleasure influences political and
               gambling decisions. Participants received two questionnaires. On
               Questionnaire 1, they rated the pleasure/displeasure of a series
               of items: social and political issues in Experiment 1, winning
               bets in Experiment 2, and losing bets in Experiment 3. On
