  volume    =  50,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "445--471",
  abstract  = "Objectives: To apply crime-specific models based on differing
               potential offender pools and opportunity structures to temporary
               and permanent motor vehicle theft (MVT). Method: Using 310 U.S.
               cities with 50,000 or more residents, the current study developed
               and examined crime-specific multivariate models for temporary and
