               police force size, social service providers, and women's safety
               at home. To address this issue, we use data from the National
               Crime Victimization Survey to examine patterns of intimate
               partner violence for 40 metropolitan statistical areas (MSAs)
               over a 16‐year period (1989–2004). We analyze the data using
