               violence. Future research should develop collaborative data
               collection efforts to examine the specific activities of police
               and social service workers in dealing with intimate partner
               violence so that the mechanisms underlying these significant
               relationships can be understood more clearly.",
  month     =  nov,
  year      =  2012,
  keywords  = "National Crime Victimization Survey (NCVS); intimate partner
               violence; mandatory arrest laws; police; social
               services",
  language  = "en"
}

