  volume    =  32,
  number    =  5,
  pages     = "612--636",
  abstract  = "The relation between different levels of public concern about the
               environment and sociodemographic and behavioral variables are
               main issues in several recent investigations. Many of these are
               based on the idea that environmental interest is shaped by
               personal beliefs. However, the internal structure of those
               beliefs is not well understood. In this investigation, 3 studies
