  publisher = "Springer Science and Business Media LLC",
  pages     = "1--36",
  abstract  = "AbstractPublic and private organizations regularly run awareness
               campaigns to combat financial fraud. However, there is little
               empirical evidence as to whether such campaigns work. This paper
               considers a campaign by a systemically important Danish bank,
