  address   = "Amsterdam",
  volume    =  25,
  number    =  4,
  pages     = "381--395",
  abstract  = "This paper tries to reconcile two sets of apparently
               contradictory results. One is the positive link, postulated in
               literature, between place attachment and civic activity, the
               other is the sociological claim that there is a negative
               relationship between place attachment and a person's social and
               cultural status (cultural capital), which in turn is known to be
