               resultats appellent la remise en quesiton des postulats
               fondamentaux sur lesquels les approches fonctionnalistes
               reposent. Functionalist theory has provided two distinct
               interpretations of the implications which crime has for patterns
               of social order. The first which is derived from the writings of
               Durkheim and Mead emphasizes the functional character of these
