               citizens view the police, while accounting for contextual,
               neighborhood-level variables. Design/methodology/approach This
               study utilized a representative victimization survey conducted in
               Saginaw, MI in 2015. Utilizing a sample of 824 individuals, an
               ordinary least-squares model was fit in order to determine the
