  publisher = "Elsevier BV",
  volume    =  45,
  number    = "C",
  pages     = "103--115",
  abstract  = "What determines whether people consider an environment to be safe
               or unsafe? In two studies, we employed a multi-level model to
               examine how safety-related environmental characteristics and
               individual characteristics influence people's perception of the
               safety of night-time urban environments. Both studies support
