  volume    =  40,
  number    =  5,
  pages     = "370--378",
  abstract  = "This study examines gender differences in the effectiveness of
               prison in reducing recidivism.Using data on released male and
               female prisoners, we apply a propensity score matching
               methodology to compare the effects of prison on recidivism versus
               three counterfactual conditions—jail, intensive probation, and
