  pages     = "825--839",
  abstract  = "A key challenge for public administrators is facilitating
               communication among diverse actors. This article illustrates the
               information seeking and sharing preferences of notable emergency
               information suppliers on social media who operate primarily
               within four states. Through homophily and brokerage analyses, two
