               employed in identifying crimes and criminals. The objective of
               this study is to predict the type of crime that occurred in the
               city and identify the important features that make this
               prediction using a machine learning technique. For this
               experimental investigation, a supervised learning method was used
               to classify the types of crimes based on the final labelled class
               that indicates which type of crime is committed. Thus, decision
               tree (DT), random forest (RF), and K-nearest neighbor (KNN)
               algorithms are utilized along with the Python programming
