  abstract  = "Rates of family violence, including intimate partner violence
               (IPV) and child maltreatment, remain high in the U.S. and
               contribute to substantial health and economic costs. How
               neighborhood environment may influence family violence remains
               poorly understood. We examine the association between
               neighborhood vacant and abandoned properties and family violence,
