  journal   = "Crime prevention and community safety",
  publisher = "Springer Science and Business Media LLC",
  volume    =  26,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "47--90",
  abstract  = "Crime and criminality are global concerns that pose significant
               risks to societal well-being and quality of life. The
               urbanization process and the land use of cities profoundly
               influence the occurrence, types, and intensity of crimes. The
