               crime scripts: (1) threats, sextortion and dissemination; (2)
               unauthorised access of a victim’s mobile device and
               dissemination; and (3) covert intimate filming. We highlight
               areas for potential intervention for law enforcement agencies and
               policy makers to increase deterrence and personal security in
