               adequate and timely treatment. This systematic review sheds more
               light on this by providing an overview of both risk and
               protective factors for sexual exploitation in male and female
               youth from a cross-cultural perspective. In all, 65 studies were
               selected meeting the inclusion criteria: qualitative or
               quantitative peer-reviewed studies in English, Dutch, or German
