               known about how small- and medium-sized enterprises respond to
               victimization and what factors contribute to the decision to pay
               the ransom. This study uses a survey with a vignette experiment
               conducted among 445 owners and managers of Dutch small- and
               medium-sized enterprises to gain more insight into the factors
