  abstract  = "Although theory and research suggest that resident territorial
               commitment relates to home personalization and maintenance, it is
               uncertain whether naive observers can ordinarily perceive this
               commitment when looking at the home. In three experiments, judges
               were shown photographs of the front exteriors of homes owned by
               residents reporting strong or weak territorial commitments to
               their home and to their block. Across all three experiments
