               are the relevant dimensions or factors across different adjacent
               neighborhood sets which are indicative of social and physical
               characteristics of people and places? 2) Can crime be explained
               through a hypothesized model which integrates the concepts of
               defensible space, and social indicators? 3) Are there
               fluctuations in the hypothetical model based on the type of
               neighborhood, based on the crime rates, or within spatially
