               transaction costs and insulates against law enforcement in drug
               distribution networks and what role fronting plays in the
               management of interpersonal network ties. The emphasis is on the
               cooperative dimension of credits.Methods:Qualitative interviews
               were conducted with 68 incarcerated drug dealers in Norwegian
               prisons. Most were mid-level dealers (66 percent), dealing with
