  author    = "Phillips, Nickie D and Chagnon, Nicholas",
  journal   = "Crime, media, culture",
  publisher = "SAGE Publications",
  abstract  = "In this paper, we examine the role played by popular media in
               propagating myths around policing and buttressing the
