  abstract  = "This study reports on the cost benefits of an intensive treatment
               program for unmanageable juvenile delinquent boys, compared to
               the usual treatment in a secured juvenile corrections facility. A
               total of 101 boys who received the majority of their treatment
               services in a specialized program providing intensive mental
               health treatment were matched to a group of 101 juveniles who
