  volume    =  34,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "47--76",
  abstract  = "Abstract In February 2012, George Zimmerman, a Hispanic man, shot
               and killed Trayvon Martin, an African-American teen, after
               encountering Martin walking in a hoodie in the rain in his
               neighborhood. A media frenzy followed, focusing on the racial
