  volume    =  13,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "1--11",
  abstract  = "Background setting Domestic violence (DV) perpetrated against
               male victims has received little attention in the literature,
               since men are generally the perpetrators rather than victims of
               DV. This study examines the characteristics of adult male victims
               and female Persons of Interest (POIs) suspected and/or charged
