               plates scanned, “hits,” arrests and recoveries with LPR). These
               results are impressive for the field of auto theft where so
               little research tested interventions exist. Future work will
               involve developing strategies that maintains the documented
               benefits of LPR use by a specialized unit, but also achieve the
               benefits associated with manual checking by a specialized unit.",
