               forecasting is consistently successful over months. Second, we
               use a state dependence (boost) framework of the number of crimes
               in the periods prior to the forecasted month. This algorithm is
               implemented in Microsoft Excel®, making it simple to apply and
               completely transparent. Results shows high accuracy and high
