  volume    =  59,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "1045--1059",
  abstract  = "This report introduces the COVID-19 Family Environment Scale
               (CHES), which aims to measure the impact of social distancing due
               to COVID-19 on household conflict and cohesion. Existing measures
               do not capture household experiences relevant to the pandemic, in
               which families are largely confined to their homes while sharing
               a life-threatening situation. Using best practice guidelines, we
