               in group meetings each successive year as the criterion.
               Time-varying predictors at level-1 included prior participation
               in group meetings as a control, the types of group meetings that
               participants attended, the number of face-to-face meetings held
               between each participant and organizing staff of the local
               organizing initiatives, and a measure of the involvement of
