  volume    =  38,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "222--232",
  abstract  = "Our study explores the role of victims' consultation with others
               about whether or not to report their rape to police. Three groups
               were observed within this sample of 435 rape victims from a
               national telephone household probability sample of women: those
               who did not consult with anyone about reporting (n = 364), those
