               Strategy (CARS) corresponded with a change in the number of
               traffic crashes that resulted in injuries after implementation
               onset. Under the CARS model, police developed tactics that
               focused on targeting high-risk driving behaviors, impaired
               drivers, and crash hotspot locations within the city.Using a
               two-phase strategy we first assess local impact by examining
               injury-related traffic crash patterns at targeted locations.
