  abstract  = "The purpose of this paper is to draw a panorama of principal
               trends which have sustained American and European research about
               fear of crime. Three principal orientations characterise the
               research. In the first trend interest is focussed on the effects
               of environmental factors on the fear of crime. The second trend
               emphasis the differences between subjects and assesses the effect
