               that increase PA time for children, without putting added
               pressure on the school curriculum, merit consideration. Before
               implementing such solutions, it is important to demonstrate that
               active school transport is associated with health-related
               outcomes. METHODS: Following a standardized protocol, we
               conducted a systematic review of published research to address
