  volume    =  75,
  number    =  5,
  pages     = "618--630",
  abstract  = "The contagiousness and deadliness of COVID-19 have necessitated
               drastic social management to halt transmission. The immediate
               effects of a nationwide lockdown were investigated by comparing
               matched samples of New Zealanders assessed before (Nprelockdown =
               1,003) and during the first 18 days of lockdown (Nlockdown =
