  journal  = "The journals of gerontology. Series B, Psychological sciences and
              social sciences",
  volume   =  71,
  number   =  6,
  pages    = "978--986",
  abstract = "OBJECTIVES: To examine the role of numeracy, or comfort with
              numbers, as a potential risk factor for financial elder
              exploitation in a community sample. METHOD: Individually
              administered surveys were given to 201 independent,
              community-dwelling adults aged 60 and older. Risk for financial
