  volume    =  53,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "149--159",
  abstract  = "BACKGROUND: The effective implementation of government policies
               and measures for controlling the coronavirus disease 2019
               (COVID-19) pandemic requires compliance from the public. This
               study aimed to examine cross-sectional and longitudinal
               associations of trust in government regarding COVID-19 control
