               survey was significantly associated with lower rate of decline in
               health behaviours over time (p for interaction = 0.001).
               CONCLUSIONS: These results highlighted the importance of trust in
               government in the control of COVID-19.",
  month     =  jan,
  year      =  2023,
  keywords  = "",
  language  = "en"
}

