  number    =  3,
  pages     = "301--332",
  abstract  = "AbstractThis article explores the emerging problem of drug- and
               alcohol-impaired e-scooter riding. Fifteen government and
               e-scooter hire firm professionals from four jurisdictions
               (Australia, Belgium, New Zealand, Norway) described and assessed
               countermeasures designed to deter drug- and alcohol-impaired
