               offender groups.This paper presents a comprehensive review of the
               literature on the link between developmental trajectories of
               offending and adult mental health outcomes (i.e., anxiety and/or
               depression).A meta-analysis was carried out to synthesize
               information on different offender types and associated adult
               mental health problems. Analyses were based on data from
