               non-discretionary, and/or neighborhood contextual factors.
               Design/methodology/approach – Data are analyzed from more than
               10,000 burglary incidents in Philadelphia from 2010 using
               multilevel models to simultaneously test for the influence of
               multiple perspectives of the factors of crime clearance. Findings
