  pages     = "634--651",
  abstract  = "Little is known about how older women cope in long-term abusive
               intimate relationships. Understanding their coping strategies may
               give insight into how to further support their effective coping
               efforts. Interviews were conducted with 38 women older than age
               55 years. Grounded theory analysis demonstrated that women who
