  volume    =  30,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "186--199",
  abstract  = "Police patrol, motorized and foot, has a long history of being
               used as a crime prevention method. Scientific evaluations of this
               crime prevention technique have been undertaken for at least 40
               years, with mixed results. One of the important questions to be
               answered regarding the implementation of a police patrol is the
