  publisher = "Elsevier BV",
  volume    =  63,
  pages     = "41--48",
  abstract  = "Purpose Estimating the size of the sex buyer market in the United
               States has been stymied by methodological and sampling
               challenges. Given known methodological issues in self-reporting
               and the sensitive nature of purchasing sex, current research
