  volume    =  3,
  number    =  4,
  pages     = "322--330",
  abstract  = "In England and Wales, the 'public confidence agenda' has enjoined
               the police service together with their key local partner, local
               authorities (Home Office, 2008). Yet before the police can
               consider this partnership to reduce crime and local disorder,
               they must know what people think about policing itself. This
               paper presents a model built around the question 'do police do a
