               victim-survivors’ offering solid evidence of the prevalence of
               sexual violence in these communities, this kind of abuse is
               generally not reported to criminal justice agencies (Gilligan, P.
               and Akhtar, S. (2006). ‘Cultural Barriers to the Disclosure of
               Child Sexual Abuse in Asian Communities: Listening to What Women
