  volume    =  10,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "223--237",
  abstract  = "A community survey examined factors affecting the trust of four
               groups involved in a high concern controversy over the risks
               posed by motor boats to the quality of a municipal water supply.
               In an effort at conceptual integration the survey results were
               used to examine the relationships between three concepts of
