               identify the solutions that will most likely be effective.
               Although the profile of analysis has been raised in recent years,
               its routine production has often resulted in many analysis
               products often offering only a descriptive presentation of the
               problem that is being examined, rather than one that is
               explanatory in its tone. In this article, we propose the use of a
