  pages     =  102190,
  abstract  = "Scholars have proposed several underlying mechanisms to explain
               the relationship between economic inequality and crime. However,
               these mechanisms have not been empirically tested. This study
               empirically tests the causal paths offered by three salient
               mechanisms through which economic inequality may affect crime:
