               the USA 46 states have responded by enacting data breach
               notification statutes designed to help consumers protect their
               information by providing organizations with guidelines to follow
               in reporting data breaches.In this paper Cohen and Felson's
               routine activity theory is used to explain why it is that these
               breaches or personal information occur.Next, data breach security
