  volume    =  13,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "63--69",
  abstract  = "A model of individual sexual offenders' spatial activity was
               developed based upon 45 British male sexual assaulters who had
               committed at least two assaults. For each offender a separate map
               was produced indicating the spatial locations of his offences and
               residence. A Marauder model and a Commuter model of offender's
