               methodological characteristics of each study with attention to
               the assumptions for causal inference. Methods: We conducted a
               pre-registered narrative systematic review on 12 independent
               studies. Results: Studies closely adhering to causal inference
               assumption checks (i.e., excludability and ignorability) find
