               between Housing NSW and two universities. Designing Out Crime at
               the University of Technology Sydney is one of the partners. The
               work focuses on developing design explorations addressing
               community safety, urban renewal and crime prevention initiatives
               in Mount Druitt, NSW. This article discusses how these design
               processes have influenced partnerships and community development.
