              destructive of painful evil (ibid) and Alison (2005: 214) argues
              that the potential to avoid aversive conditions bears a close
              relationship to negative reinforcement . The issues of fear
              association and negative reinforcement are discussed in Chapter 3.
              Fear, according to Ditton et al (1999: 83), is a term encompassing
