               social inequality in terms of exposure to health risks and access
               to health resources. We discuss the opportunities and challenges
               focusing on the potential seemingly offered by focusing on human
               mobility, and specifically the utilization of activity space
               concepts and data. A goal of the paper is to spatialize social
