  volume    =  87,
  number    =  5,
  pages     = "1561--1588",
  abstract  = "Can participation in financial markets lead individuals to
               reevaluate the costs of conflict, change their political
               attitudes, and even their votes? Prior to the 2015 Israeli
               elections, we randomly assigned Palestinian and Israeli financial
               assets to likely voters and incentivized them to actively trade
