  number    =  2,
  pages     = "180--197",
  abstract  = "AbstractAfter sustained reductions in robberies and thefts in
               2016, the city of Montevideo, Uruguay, experienced a sudden
               increase in these crimes in late 2017. Using interrupted time
               series regressions, and controlling for seasonality using ARIMA
               models, we investigated three potential explanations for this
