  pages     = "119--140",
  abstract  = "Land-use and environmental planning typically involves diverse
               actors such as representatives of government authorities and
               administrations, special interest organisations, scientific
               experts, lawyers, stakeholders and concerned citizens. During the
               course of the planning process, communication is not limited to
               written documents. The Swedish Environmental Code also calls for
               public meetings and consultation efforts with stakeholders.
