               (CRM) systems (e.g., 311 hotlines). Some reports seek to
               counteract deterioration or disorder in urban neighborhoods
               (e.g., potholes), suggesting that they might be motivated by
               territoriality. We examined this question through a survey of CRM
               users in Boston, MA, which was combined with their patterns of
