  volume    =  44,
  number    =  6,
  pages     = "931--945",
  abstract  = "The paper seeks to clarify the risks of repeat personal
               victimization, acknowledging that much prior research is limited
               in enabling efficient applicability to crime-prevention purposes
               by its failure to address the interplay between personal and
               household factors conferring risk alongside the effects of prior
