               .084). CONCLUSIONS: Public health messaging may need to emphasize
               the role that friends and families can play in helping to protect
               those in their friendship/family groups by promoting compliance
               with social distancing. Further in-depth studies are recommended
               to evaluate how this kind of messaging can most effectively
               encourage people to engage in social distancing practices.",
