  pages     = "280--293",
  abstract  = "AbstractThis paper estimates the impact of police presence on
               crime using a unique database that tracks the exact location of
               Dallas Police Department patrol cars throughout 2009. To address
               the concern that officer location is often driven by crime, my
               instrument exploits police responses to calls outside their
