  volume    =  31,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "1--17",
  abstract  = "This study examines the assumption that aspects of fear of crime
               (fear of rape and sense of insecurity) predict fear of terrorism.
               The online survey included 754 Israeli respondents, who answered
               questions about their demographic characteristics, fear of
               terrorism, fear of crime indicators (fear of rape and sense of
