  volume    =  8,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "1--32",
  abstract  = "Using 50,000 tests published in the AER, JPE, and QJE, we
               identify a residual in the distribution of tests that cannot be
               explained solely by journals favoring rejection of the null
               hypothesis. We observe a two-humped camel shape with missing
