  volume    =  13,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "116--150",
  abstract  = "Using a 1993 Dutch policy reform and a regression discontinuity
               design, we find children of parents whose disability insurance
               (DI) eligibility was reduced are 11 percent less likely to
