  volume    =  126,
  number    =  4,
  pages     = "287--293",
  abstract  = "Italy was the first European country to experience a huge
               outbreak of the COVID-19 pandemic and to implement various
               policies in order to contain the spread of the virus. This paper
               analyses the effects of policies implemented by the Italian
               government in response to the virus's spread in the first and the
