  author    = "Manica, Mattia and Guzzetta, Giorgio and Riccardo, Flavia and
               Valenti, Antonio and Poletti, Piero and Marziano, Valentina and
               Trentini, Filippo and Andrianou, Xanthi and Mateo-Urdiales,
