  volume    =  188,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "327--345",
  abstract  = "This paper develops methodology for semiparametric panel data
               models in a setting where both the time series and the cross
               section are large. Such settings are common in finance and other
               areas of economics. Our model allows for heterogeneous
               nonparametric covariate effects as well as unobserved time and
