  volume    =  145,
  number    = "1-2",
  pages     = "158--173",
  abstract  = "This paper examines criminal choice using a variant of the human
               capital model. The innovation of our approach is that it attempts
               to disaggregate individual capital, not unlike production-based
               studies which disaggregate physical capital into equipment and
               structures. We disaggregate an individual’s capital stock into
