  number    =  1,
  pages     = "56--71",
  abstract  = "This paper studies inference in a continuous time game where an
               agent's decision to quit an activity depends on the participation
               of other players. In equilibrium, similar actions can be
               explained not only by direct influences but also by correlated
               factors. Our model can be seen as a simultaneous duration model
