  pages     = "412--428",
  abstract  = "Many violent relationships are characterized by a high degree of
               cyclicality: women who are the victims of domestic violence often
               leave and return multiple times. To explain this we develop a
               model of time inconsistent preferences in the context of domestic
               violence. This time inconsistency generates a demand for
