               on the cohorts exposed to educational disruptions. First, we
               document that the number of new admissions and graduates in
               post-secondary education declined significantly due to the
               turmoil. The decline in post-secondary graduation ratio is 6.6
               percentage points for the exposed individuals. Second, we
