  volume    =  125,
  number    =  586,
  pages     = "F203--F232",
  abstract  = "I examine the post-war economic development of two regions in
               southern Italy exposed to mafia activity after the 1970s and
               apply synthetic control methods to estimate their counterfactual
               economic performance in the absence of organized crime. The
               synthetic control is a weighted average of other regions less
