  volume    =  138,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "103--150",
  abstract  = "Abstract We experimentally test several approaches to increasing
               the demand for workers with a criminal record on a nationwide
               staffing platform by addressing potential downside risk and
               productivity concerns. The staffing platform asked hiring
               managers to make a series of hypothetical hiring decisions that
               affected whether workers with a criminal record could accept
