  volume    =  85,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "821--864",
  abstract  = "Does a greater police presence cause crime rates to decrease? To
               answer this question, we circumvent common simultaneity and
               reverse causality issues by exploiting an experiment from college
               football. In 2013, the Big XII added an eighth referee to
               conference games only. Unique features of this experiment allow
