  volume    =  10,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "298--330",
  abstract  = "We investigate whether individuals' risk preferences change after
               experiencing a natural disaster, specifically, the 2011 Great
               East Japan Earthquake. Exploiting the panels of nationally
               representative surveys on risk preferences, we find that men who
               experienced greater intensity of the earthquake became more risk
