  pages     = "1222--12710R2",
  abstract  = "This study explores the effect of in-person schooling on youth
               suicide in the United States. We show that youth suicide rates
               historically declined during summers and rose again earlier in
               counties with an August school starting date. We document a
               departure from this pattern at the onset of the COVID-19
