  number    =  4,
  pages     = "1557--1603",
  abstract  = "Modern information technologies make it possible to store,
               analyze, and trade unprecedented amounts of detailed information
               about individuals. This has led to public discussions on whether
               individuals' privacy should be better protected by restricting
               the amount or the precision of information that is collected by
