  pages     = "2375--2398",
  abstract  = "We study the classic transfer problem using the largest
               historical example, the Franco-Prussian War indemnity of
               1871–1873 which saw France transfer to Germany 25\% of a year's
               GDP. A dynamic, two-country model allows for debt finance,
