  number    =  3,
  pages     = "1--18",
  abstract  = "Sparked by high-profile confrontations between police and
               citizens in Ferguson, Missouri, and elsewhere, many commentators
               have criticized the excessive militarization of law enforcement.
               We investigate whether surplus military-grade equipment acquired
               by local police departments from the Pentagon has an effect on
