  number    =  1,
  pages     = "206--238",
  abstract  = "Targeting assistance to the poor is a central problem in
               development. We study the problem of designing a proxy means test
               when the implementing agent is corruptible. Conditioning on more
               poverty indicators may worsen targeting in this environment
               because of a novel tradeoff between statistical accuracy and
