  volume    =  14,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "87--127",
  abstract  = "Certain markets are illicit because part of the supply is
               coerced, but little is known about the optimal regulation of such
               markets. We model a prostitution market with voluntary and
               coerced prostitutes and ask what regulation can restore the
