  volume    =  16,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "290--313",
  abstract  = "Millions of Americans must navigate complex government procedures
               under the threat of punishment. Violating these requirements can
               lead to poverty traps or deepening legal system involvement. We
               use a field experiment to estimate the effect of failing to
               appear for court on subsequent legal contact. The treatments
