  volume    =  16,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "1--36",
  abstract  = "Does the presence of underrepresented racial/ethnic groups in a
               legislative body differentially impact outcomes for members of
               those groups? We study close elections between White and
               non-White candidates for California city council and the
               corresponding impact on housing values, a summary statistic for
