  journal   = "Journal of law, economics, \& organization",
  publisher = "Oxford University Press (OUP)",
  volume    =  34,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "364--394",
  abstract  = "We utilize data from sensitive soccer games in 75 countries
               between the years 2001 and 2013. In these games one team was in
               immediate danger of relegation to a lower division (Team A) and
               another team was not affected by the result (Team B). Using
               within-country variation, our difference-in-difference analysis
               reveals that the more corrupt the country, according to
