  volume    =  38,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "196--271",
  abstract  = "AbstractThis paper evaluates if same-sex marriage (SSM) laws,
               approved in several European Union countries over the past
               decades, have contributed to favor gay-friendly opinions among
               people depending on their social interactions. We propose a
               dyadic model in which individuals learn about the social norm
