  number    =  6,
  pages     = "1130--1141",
  abstract  = "We conduct an applied welfare economics analysis of cigarette tax
               avoidance. We develop an extension of the standard formula for
               the optimal Pigouvian corrective tax to incorporate the
               possibility that consumers avoid the tax by making purchases in
               nearby lower tax jurisdictions. To provide a key parameter for
