               Recherche [Grant ANR-11-LABX-0042] of Universite de Lyon within
               the program Investissements Avenir operated by the Agence
               Nationale de la Recherche [Grant ANR-11-IDEX-007]. Supplemental
               Material: The data files and online appendix are available at
