  volume    =  60,
  number    =  7,
  pages     = "1617--1631",
  abstract  = "Movie producers and exhibitors make various decisions requiring
               an understanding of moviegoer's preferences at the local level.
               Two examples of such decisions are exhibitors' allocation of
               screens to movies and producers' allocation of advertising across
