  pages     = "781--801",
  abstract  = "We propose and examine a panel data model for isolating the
               effect of a treatment, taken once at baseline, from outcomes
               observed over subsequent time periods. In the model, the
               treatment intake and outcomes are assumed to be correlated, due
               to unobserved or unmeasured confounders. Intake is partly
