  author    = "Aidt, T S and Franck, R",
  journal   = "Econometrica",
  publisher = "Wiley Online Library",
  abstract  = "We examine the link between the threat of violence and
               democratization in the context of the Great Reform Act passed by
               the British Parliament in 1832. We geo‐reference the so‐called
               Swing riots, which occurred between the 1830 and 1831
               parliamentary elections, and compute the number of these riots
