  volume    =  89,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "647--676",
  abstract  = "We investigate learning at the workplace. To do so, we use German
               administrative data that contain information on the entire
               workforce of a sample of establishments. We document that having
               more‐highly‐paid coworkers is strongly associated with future
               wage growth, particularly if those workers earn more. Motivated
