  number    =  6,
  pages     = "1545--1578",
  abstract  = "We argue that the current framework for predictive ability
               testing (e.g., West, 1996) is not necessarily useful for
               real-time forecast selection, i.e., for assessing which of two
               competing forecasting methods will perform better in the future.
               We propose an alternative framework for out-of-sample comparison
