  number    =  5,
  pages     = "1659--1693",
  abstract  = "We study the investment effects of market integration on
               renewable energy expansion. Our theory highlights that market
               integration not only improves allocative efficiency by gains from
               trade but also incentivizes new investment in renewable power
               plants. To test our theoretical predictions, we examine how
