  volume    =  71,
  number    =  4,
  pages     = "1161--1189",
  abstract  = "We are interested in estimating the average effect of a binary
               treatment on a scalar outcome. If assignment to the treatment is
               independent of the potential outcomes given pretreatment
               variables, biases associated with simple treatment-control
               average comparisons can be removed by adjusting for differences
