  number    =  2,
  pages     = "196--212",
  abstract  = "An important force combatting crime consists of the help and
               cooperation that citizens provide to the victims of crime and to
               the criminal justice system. This paper analyzes such behavior in
               light of economic theories of altruism. Using survey data on
               responses to questions about hypothetical situations involving
