  publisher = "Wiley Online Library",
  abstract  = "This paper studies (nonparametric) partial identification of
               treatment response with social interactions. It imposes
               conditions motivated by economic theory on the primitives of the
               model, that is, the structural equations, and shows that they
               imply shape restrictions on the distribution of potential
