  pages    = "523--529",
  abstract = "Little is known about how much smartphone apps for weight control
              adhere to evidence-informed practices. The aim of this study was
              to review and summarize the content of available weight control
              apps. Information on content, user rating, and price was extracted
              from iTunes on September 25, 2009. Apps (n = 204) were coded for
